Z||000000||fierospeeder||10-24-2001||04:14 PM||||just gotta vent  <P>So its raining in illinois.  I get out of class in college and on my way home using my moms van.  My tbird is at the trans shop.<P>I guess dupage county has poor sewer systems and the right lane is usually flooded in some areas.  This is a two lane road on each side.<P>So everyones driving slow.  UGH.  comeon people atleast go the speed limit or "STAY IN THE RIGHT LANE"  So this little jap red foreign car is speeding up in the right lane so i change lanes and get behind him.  Next thing i noticed he slams on his brakes.  Im like s**t.  I think the van has abs but not sure.  Im like here i go, im going to slam into him.  I came about a foot or less from hitting him.  Thank you got for the 4 inches of water that slowed me down, because the jag off and to slow down for.  <P>I would have been screwed, almost new van, and it has air bags, not like those are expensive.<P><BR>So all these freaking people are driving slow.  Slower then the speed limit, atleast 10 under.  And the parts of the road that are flooded with 4-6 inches of water.  Everyone jams on their brakes or goes in the oncoming lanes to go around it.  Like thats safe, same as going around R&R crossing guards.  Ill be changing lanes and go in the right lane which is deeper and go the speed limit and all the water gets on the slower people.  woohoo.<P>SUVs, what a joke.  These morons have to slow down.  I guess their vehicles are to "car like" or not being used as they were suppose to.   Get a freaking van, if you cant go 40 through water like i am.  Just a waste.  <P>Other people can vent about their daily driving also.  This is i believe the 4th posting of idiot drivers.<P>Im trying to remember the other incidents i had recently.  One was on my motorcycle and some guy cuts me off in front of me to take a left turn  to a side street which would be my right.  It was a freaking close.<P>Another motorcycle.  Some dago, in a jap car, thats a beater is driving really fast.  Im sitting at the stop light, (at night).  And i see him coming.  I hear him skidding to a stop, and i did move up before he was going to stop.  Im thinking he could have hit me.  After the light turns green, we get on another road and later passes me.  Hes going about 50 in a 25mph road.  I wanted to get his plate but there wasn't one.<P><BR>Things i hate,  <P>people that turn on their turn signal, while they are turning  (thanks for the warning)<P>People who stop 3-4 car length from the car in front of them, or if they are the first at the stop light, the same thing.<P>People that think they are faster then my motorcycle.  1/4 12.3 secs, its 50hp.  And they are driving non "sport" car vehicles.<P>People that follow you on the side while you speed up.   Or they speed up to catch up to you.  Example.<P>Im driving with no cars around me, and you see a car in your rearview speeding about 10 over.  They pass you and then slow down to your speed about a car or 2 length a head.  Why not continue speeding??????????<P>People that love to waste gas.  Supply and demand, thats why 1 reason gas is so high.  People that are speeding and there going to make a turn on the next block.<P>I got more things but i cant remember them all of them.  Going to work soon, so ill check back for the flaming.<BR>||||reg||1
