Z||000006||fierospeeder||10-24-2001||10:15 PM||||Im only going to COD for a year, then im going back to UIC, which i was at.<P>Im just hoping they accept my application.   I got another week, or 2 for a response.  I just want to go back, for the Spring semester.<P>I really hate school.  I would like to go to a technical school, but i wouldn't get the BA in computer science.  I love my computer classes, but everything else is a drag.  COD has all the good computer classes at night, which totally sucks.  So im taking an easy class now, thats what they only have in the day time. <P>UIC has some stupid qualities and COD does also.  UIC wont let you take more then one entrance exam, but COD will let you take it 3? times.  So i was stuck at UIC taking algebra and had to work my way to calculus.  <BR>UIC classes are always full.  And i had to wait till next semester to take the class i need.  Which just delays my graduation date.  UIC has those stupid telephone registrations, and COD has that, plus online registration which is so much better.  I can see what classes are available.  COD-free parking.  UIC parking is 160 a semester unless it went up.  UIC's ideal class selection for computer science doesn't work out.  Ya you start out in calculus, but that doesn't work.  And picking classes is done by senority.  So freshman year, was pretty much a pain in the ass.  I hated my counseler, ya she was hot, but a total moron, didn't help me at all, and i just picked my schedule on my own.<P><BR>So coming back from school, two days ago.  Im in my moms van, (raining, so i cant take the motorcycle), and on 1/8 tank full of gas so im doing my slow accelerations during the stop lights to save gas.  So theres these old people in a white foreign car on the right lane.  So they accelerate faster, and out of no place just cut right in front of me, no turn signal at all.  <P>For the next 5 miles.  Freaking 5 miles.  they are in front of me going the speed limit, and im the one "THAT GO 10MPH over the limit, because thats what the cops told me when i get pulled over, anything more then 10 is a ticket."  So im on their ass, not really tailgating but doing my 1 second rule.  And i couldn't pass there was no place to pass on the right side, and the people on the ride side were going the same speed as the car in front of me(i totally hate that) double blockers of two lanes.<P><BR>Anyway, did anyone go to chuckie's wedding?<P>||||reg||1
